{
  "title": "The Reincarnated Elf Left on a Journey to Master His Magic and with His Extra Lifespan Became a Living Legend",
  "description": "This the long tale of a reincarnated elf who become a living legend!\n\nAfter his ordinary life came to an end in an accident, Minoru was reincarnated as an elf who have a average lifespan of 1000 years. Due to the regret of not being able to do anything in his previous life, he decided to leave his village and travel in this life to leave behind evidence that he once lived in this world. However, the head of the elf clan imposes a certain trial—?!",
